###  https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#AdversePublicityOrReputation
:AdversePublicityOrReputation rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#Concept> ;
                              <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "08/09/2020" ;
                              <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Rob" ;
                              <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Part 2" ;
                              rdfs:comment "Adverse publicity in the media, loss of public confidence in a service or the organisation e.g. poor service performance." ;
                              rdfs:label "Adverse Publicity/Reputation" ;
                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#definition> "Adverse publicity in the media, loss of public confidence in a service or the organisation e.g. poor service performance." ;
                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#prefLabel> "Adverse Publicity/Reputation" .


###  https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Anticipate
:Anticipate rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#Concept> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "07/09/2020" ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Rob" ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Part 1" ;
            rdfs:comment "Anticipation involves thinking ahead and envisioning the things that are most likely to contribute to risk or safety failures. Safety from this perspective therefore involves looking ahead and identifying the hazards and risks that may cause harm if left unmanaged." ;
            rdfs:label "Anticipate" ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#definition> "Anticipation involves thinking ahead and envisioning the things that are most likely to contribute to risk or safety failures. Safety from this perspective therefore involves looking ahead and identifying the hazards and risks that may cause harm if left unmanaged." ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#prefLabel> "Anticipate" .


