###  https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#ProjectRisk
:ProjectRisk rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#Concept> ;
             <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "07/09/2020" ;
             <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Rob" ;
             <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Part 1/ISO 31000:2009" ;
             rdfs:comment "Project risks relate to the achievement and delivery of the project objectives and outcomes. The majority of project risks are short term in nature and exist for the term of the project, whilst some will be on-going and re-classified at the end of the project. Projects can be defined as temporary, with the aim of delivering outcomes within a specified timeframe." ;
             rdfs:label "Project Risk" ;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#definition> "Project risks relate to the achievement and delivery of the project objectives and outcomes. The majority of project risks are short term in nature and exist for the term of the project, whilst some will be on-going and re-classified at the end of the project. Projects can be defined as temporary, with the aim of delivering outcomes within a specified timeframe." ;
             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#prefLabel> "Project Risk" .


