###  https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskAppetite
:RiskAppetite rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#Concept> ;
              <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "07/09/2020" ;
